<title>USA: Pool Energy completes DA&amp;S acquisition.</title>
<headline>Pool Energy completes DA&amp;S acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pool Energy Services Co has completed its previously announced acquisition of privately-owned DA&amp;S Oil Well Servicing Inc, an operator of 37 land well-servicing rigs in New Mexico and Texas.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to increase Pool's annual revenues by approximately $12 million, based upon current activity levels, Pool Energy said.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
